The legal texts are the Constitution of Virginia and chapters 1 to 6 of Title 18.2 of the Code of Virginia, as published by the Virginia Division of Legislative Services (law.lis.virginia.gov). Statutes and constitutions are
not copyrightable subject matter (Georgia v. Public.Resource.Org, 2020); only the law text is taken, never annotations, notes
or editorial material. The site footer reserves rights in the site itself, not in the law; it publishes no robots.txt.
Source: the Virginia Division of Legislative Services, law.lis.virginia.gov.

